Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:05.12,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(316.013,72)}Come Back Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.86,0:01:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.32,0:01:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, I have said Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have said sorry. NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.97,0:01:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch, ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, I'll remember this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pound you to pulp when I see you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.35,0:01:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Bleh, I ain't scared at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.75,0:01:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to pay you back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.95,0:01:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't scared of nothing when I have Doraemon by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.95,0:01:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.12,0:01:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Lemme borrow that...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you lent me earlier, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.63,0:01:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The gadget that makes me good at fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop picking fights that you can never win!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:02:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, actually...\N we need to talk, so sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.98,0:02:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.35,0:02:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,M-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, I was meaning to say this from a few days... but I couldn't....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.13,0:02:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just spill it out...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.47,0:02:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, I must go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.31,0:02:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The future, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Going home?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You just can't go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, mom, please do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.37,0:02:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:02:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:03:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going back to the future world!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.34,0:03:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, at the earliest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.48,0:03:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, please stop him hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.01,0:03:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, Doraemon must have his own circumstances, so be reasonable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, You'll never grow up,...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,if you always rely on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.69,0:03:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.14,0:03:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate Doraemon very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.61,0:03:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We will feel lonely if Dora-{\i1}chan{\i0} leaves, I admit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.15,0:03:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Doraemon takes care of our Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.89,0:04:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have these..
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll have 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very delicious, it brings tears to my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.97,0:04:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.82,0:04:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!\N-Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nether can I!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.36,0:04:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's chat 'till morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, good ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.04,0:04:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This portion will keep us from getting tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.38,0:04:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The full moon looks so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.55,0:04:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bamboo 'copter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last time, that I'll get to fly with you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.73,0:05:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, Doraemon, let's race..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But...Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, will you be OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I never wanted to go back, if I had a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.31,0:05:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do your homework on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.12,0:05:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hit Giant and Suneo back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about such things, I can manage!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still worry about this kind of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you that I'll manage everything on my own, so you can go back in ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.67,0:05:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go take a walk in the park. \NI'll go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.95,0:05:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't wanted me to see him in all tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's such a good-hearted guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.46,0:06:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I wodner where have you gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.97,0:06:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there at this hour?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Giant
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He sleep-walks into park sometimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No response at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giant, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.71,0:06:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is speaking there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.98,0:07:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you see me sleepwalking!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard someone calling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.27,0:07:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?\NYou can't escape from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Please listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, what's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,GIant, wait a minute! Let's resume our fight after Doraemon goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You are very thoughtful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But just remember this, I won't hold off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You are all but talks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.07,0:08:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You are all but talks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,DId he head home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.45,0:08:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!! \NHe isn't home neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Got'cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Had enough? Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.22,0:08:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Do you want more?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I'm just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.73,0:08:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:08:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been an hour already...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.67,0:09:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder where he's and what he's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He makes me worried till the very end...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Had enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times we fight, the result is the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly, give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.45,0:09:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd, Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta beat you on my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, he can't go home in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's ambulance. I'll have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.45,0:09:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up, you win!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.33,0:10:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, I beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.40,0:10:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that, Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I beat Giant by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,By myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.65,0:10:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, you can go back to the future world in ease!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you drool!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, take care! Don't be rash!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:11:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, come down for breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, after you have left, my room feels so empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll get used to it in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, please don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.41,0:11:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.91,0:11:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, what are you doing?\NSuneo is calling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very busy now~!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you? You're just so lazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember your promise to Dora-{\i1}chan{\i0}!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.42,0:11:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That you'd be all right by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.03,0:11:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, Nobita, cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.31,0:12:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.01,0:12:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, Doraemon won't\Ncome back again~!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, I should be happy from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo, long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.79,0:12:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.09,0:12:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a Tsuchinoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A Tsuchinoko!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That mythological serpent?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a very big discovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.53,0:12:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I couldn't catch it by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you help me to catch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.14,0:12:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.91,0:12:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You chased it down to this pipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Poke it with a stick over there, I'll catch it over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.99,0:12:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Got 'ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.63,0:13:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, you are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.87,0:13:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me calmly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.24,0:13:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.18,0:13:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to guess who I just saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.05,0:13:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, where is he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.22,0:14:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Dora-{\i1}chan{\i0} come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't come back, will he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.99,0:14:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He have said that he won't\Ncome back again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, enough with jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.97,0:14:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange! Why don't you let me see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.97,0:14:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be shy to see so quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He was very heart-struck when\Nhe left after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.05,0:14:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.89,0:14:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.02,0:15:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see him as soon as possible\Nreally!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.26,0:15:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.30,0:15:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I take out all of my saving
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.57,0:15:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and buy the Rice Cracker for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be very happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He was deceived!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How about my idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm defeated by you really!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.05,0:15:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.49,0:15:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,April Fools' Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He was deceived actually!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.69,0:15:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very easy to cheat Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause he is too naive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.40,0:15:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody will get angry on\NApril Fools' Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.07,0:15:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell a lie too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there are ghosts behind you,\Nthe first one is a little monk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So naive lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita can only say this kind of lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, big monster...big orang...big dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.39,0:16:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, that's fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.73,0:16:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true...It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.09,0:16:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it of!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.72,0:16:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm not here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you can open this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and get what you want
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.93,0:16:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,if you can't solve something!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.73,0:16:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's will come forth really!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that it's medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It says Lie 800.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All of your words will be lie\Nafter you take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.02,0:17:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very suitable for\Nthe April Fools' Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.89,0:17:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.91,0:17:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For me, the idea that "Doraemon is back here" is the most cruel and mean lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.35,0:17:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita's here, all fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Got some pathetic jokes on your sleeve?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.48,0:17:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.29,0:17:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just speak it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.23,0:17:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The weather's very fine, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:18:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.14,0:18:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The rain is pouring in fiercely!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.31,0:18:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the April Fools' Day,\Nso I can tell a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It will rain if you say that it's very sunny today!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.29,0:18:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, it will be sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a bad guy really!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.86,0:18:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, what shall i lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you are the first one...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.17,0:18:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,NO! Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get bitten by a dog, Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.05,0:18:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me! I'm scared of dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.65,0:18:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,NO, ow..! NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:19:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn now, Giant-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be really, really praised by your mother for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, I beg you, please forgive me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.74,0:19:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Takeshi, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, mommy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! No running away...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.45,0:19:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.25,0:19:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon won't be coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:19:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never see him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.67,0:20:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But, why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.91,0:20:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I come here suddenly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very unimaginable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why, neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you must have drank the Liar Liar Liqiuid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that I won't be coming back, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not happy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to live with Doraemon like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.37,0:20:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really not happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.94,0:20:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to part with Doraemon!
